From 0e720f1c937660f027dc47f532269bfba72f8575 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <assistant@example.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 06:07:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add portfolio contact/order endpoints with email
 notifications and Swagger docs

- Add ContactSubmission and PortfolioOrder Mongoose models
- Add portfolioController with submitContact/submitOrder handlers
  - Validates required fields
  - Saves submission to MongoDB
  - Sends notification email to site owner
  - Sends auto-reply email to the submitter
- Add routes/portfolio.js: POST /api/contact and POST /api/order
- Mount portfolio routes in app.js
- Add OpenAPI 3.0 docs for /contact and /order in swagger.yaml
- Serve swagger.yaml via Swagger UI at /api-docs/portfolio
---
